hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"228","[AI-translation] Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin; woh akela hai, beshareek; badshahat usi ki hai, tareef usi ki hai; woh har cheez par qadir hai. Lautne wale, tauba karne wale, ibadat karne wale, apne Rab ki tareef karne wale. Allah ne apna wada saccha kiya, apne bande ki madad ki, girohon ko tanha shikast di. [Safar se wapsi par padhe]"
